WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.773
Benjamin held up Peter's handkerchief.

2
00:00:05.774 --> 00:00:10.466
"We can carry onions in this," said Benjamin.

3
00:00:10.467 --> 00:00:14.210
He put it on the ground.

4
00:00:14.211 --> 00:00:18.171
Benjamin went into an onion patch.

5
00:00:18.172 --> 00:00:24.552
He pulled up an onion. Shloomp!

6
00:00:24.553 --> 00:00:30.760
"This is a nice one!" said Benjamin.

7
00:00:30.761 --> 00:00:34.054
He pulled up another onion.

8
00:00:34.055 --> 00:00:36.902
Peter looked around.

9
00:00:36.903 --> 00:00:40.221
His nose wiggled.

10
00:00:40.222 --> 00:00:47.083
Benjamin pulled up more onions.

11
00:00:47.084 --> 00:00:50.740
He rolled them onto the handkerchief.

12
00:00:50.741 --> 00:00:54.057
"Let's go," said Peter.

13
00:00:54.058 --> 00:00:59.221
"This garden isn't safe."

14
00:00:59.222 --> 00:01:03.139
"It's fine," said Benjamin.

15
00:01:03.140 --> 00:01:12.201
"I come here all the time with Father."

16
00:01:12.202 --> 00:01:15.579
He ate a lettuce leaf.

17
00:01:15.580 --> 00:01:22.862
"Mmm," said Benjamin. "Yummy!"

18
00:01:22.863 --> 00:01:26.675
Benjamin walked deeper into the garden.

19
00:01:26.676 --> 00:01:32.833
Peter grabbed the handkerchief.

20
00:01:32.834 --> 00:01:43.531
He ran after his cousin.

21
00:01:43.532 --> 00:01:47.423
"What was that noise?" asked Peter.

22
00:01:47.424 --> 00:01:49.856
"Is the farmer coming?"

23
00:01:49.857 --> 00:01:53.575
"It's nothing," said Benjamin.

24
00:01:53.576 --> 00:01:57.365
Benjamin kept walking.

25
00:01:57.366 --> 00:02:03.143
Peter followed.

26
00:02:03.144 --> 00:02:09.144
They walked past flowerpots and garden tools.

27
00:02:09.145 --> 00:02:13.547
Suddenly Benjamin gasped.

28
00:02:13.548 --> 00:02:16.146
"I see a cat!"

29
00:02:16.147 --> 00:02:22.975
He and Peter slipped under a basket.

30
00:02:22.976 --> 00:02:29.204
They waited.

31
00:02:29.205 --> 00:02:37.316
Sniff, sniff. Sniff, sniff.

32
00:02:37.317 --> 00:02:40.390
The cat jumped onto the basket.

33
00:02:40.391 --> 00:02:48.729
Then she sat down.

